source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A backslash before a non-escapable character is shown as itself, so a Windows path needs no encoding.
-- input.jira --
C:\dir\file
-- rendered.html --
<p>C:\dir\file</p>
-- want.md --
C:\\dir\\file
-- warnings.json --
[]
